  "decision_conditions": [
    "The applicant has failed to demonstrate that the proposed car parking arrangements for the proposed padel courts, have been sufficiently evidenced.  It has not been demonstrated that there would be sufficient car parking or cycle parking to accommodate the proposed padel court facility or that it would not give rise to unacceptable parking pressures and impacts on the surrounding area.  As such, the proposal is contrary to Policies T5, T6 of the London Plan (2021), Policies CP 24, CP 25 of the Core Policy (2010), Policies DMD 45 and DMD 47 of the Development Management Document (2014).\r\r",
    "The applicant has failed to demonstrate, through the submission of sufficient and robust evidence, that the proposed padel courts would not result in unacceptable noise impacts on the amenities of neighbouring residential occupiers. In the absence of adequate information, it has not been established that noise generated from the use of the courts, including player activity and associated movements, could be satisfactorily mitigated to prevent harm to residential amenity. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP32 of the Core Strategy (2010), and Policy DMD68 of the Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
